<title>USA: MBIA qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Phoenix, Ariz., $32 million general obligation bonds.  </p>
<p>--St Martin Parish, La., $8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Monticello Independent School District No 882, Minn., $33.095 million GOs.  </p>
<p>--New Jersey Wastewater, $23.8 million water bonds, by direct purchase.</p>
<p>--New Jersey Wastewater, $9.95 million water bonds, by direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Pocono Mt School District, Pa., $9.995 million GOs, under the the alternate bid program.</p>
<p>--Hanover County, Va., $7.94 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
